WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.920
If your business is growing, but every important decision still comes back to you, the problem

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.560
may not be the effort.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.400
It may be the way the business is currently structured.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:16.440
Over the last 11 years, I have worked across family businesses, healthcare, aviation

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.040
and growth stage companies.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:24.000
I repeatedly saw good businesses struggle because accountability was unclear, processes

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.040
depended on individuals, and execution required constant founder follow-up.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.320
That is why I started Shikha Solutions.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:38.440
We work alongside founders to identify the real constraint, strengthen people and systems

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:42.360
and build a business that can grow without everything depending on the founder.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:47.160
If this sounds familiar, start with our business health check.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:52.280
It takes approximately 3 minutes and will help you identify what deserves your attention

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:52.720
first.

